      <h3 id="insights-operator-what-information-is-collected_about-remote-health-monitoring" class="group scroll-mt-20">Information collected by the Insights Operator<a href="#insights-operator-what-information-is-collected_about-remote-health-monitoring" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
