      <ul>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/support/remote_health_monitoring/showing-data-collected-by-remote-health-monitoring#insights-operator-showing-data-collected-from-the-cluster_showing-data-collected-by-remote-health-monitoring">Showing data collected by the Insights Operator</a></li>
